-e72c-3f91-1f24-8dfe4f379535-4f37952d\" class=\"feature-card is-active\"><img src=\"/images/site/adobe-express-file.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" sizes=\"(max-width: 767px) 100vw, (max-width: 991px) 727.9817504882812px, 939.9869384765625px\" srcset=\"/images/site/adobe-express-file-p-500.webp 500w, /images/site/adobe-express-file-p-800.webp 800w, /images/site/adobe-express-file-p-1080.webp 1080w, /images/site/adobe-express-file.webp 1251w\" class=\"feature-image\"><div class=\"block-feature\"><div class=\"pill-feature\"><h3 class=\"title-feature\">Energy Efficient Systems</h3></div><p class=\"feature-text\">Engineered energy-efficient systems include variable-speed pumps, saltwater systems, efficient heaters, and LED lighting—designed to reduce operating costs and improve long-term pool performance.</p></div></div><div class=\"feature-card\"><img src=\"/images/site/adobe-express-file-1.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" sizes=\"(max-width: 767px) 100vw, (max-width: 991px) 727.9817504882812px, 939.9869384765625px\" srcset=\"/images/site/adobe-express-file-1-p-500.webp 500w, /images/site/adobe-express-file-1-p-800.webp 800w, /images/site/adobe-express-file-1-p-1080.webp 1080w, /images/site/adobe-express-file-1.webp 1251w\" class=\"feature-image\"><div class=\"block-feature\"><div class=\"pill-feature\"><h3 class=\"title-feature\">Smart Automation</h3></div><p class=\"feature-text\">Smart pool automation allows seamless control of filtration, heating, lighting, and water features from one system—improving efficiency, convenience, and the overall luxury pool experience.</p></div></div><div class=\"feature-card\"><img src=\"/images/site/adobe-express-file-2.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" sizes=\"(max-width: 767px) 100vw, (max-width: 991px) 727.9817504882812px, 939.9869384765625px\" srcset=\"/images/site/adobe-express-file-2-p-500.webp 500w, /images/site/adobe-express-file-2-p-800.webp 800w, /images/site/adobe-express-file-2-p-1080.webp 1080w, /images/site/adobe-express-file-2.webp 1251w\" class=\"feature-image\"><div class=\"block-feature\"><div class=\"pill-feature\"><h3 class=\"title-feature\">Water Features</h3></div><p class=\"feature-text\">Custom water features such as sheer descents, scuppers, bubblers, and spillover spas are engineered to enhance visual impact, movement, and sound while integrating seamlessly into the pool design.</p></div></div><div class=\"feature-card\"><img src=\"/images/site/adobe-express-file-3.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" sizes=\"(max-width: 767px) 100vw, (max-width: 991px) 727.9817504882812px, 939.9869384765625px\" srcset=\"/images/site/adobe-express-file-3-p-500.webp 500w, /images/site/adobe-express-file-3-p-800.webp 800w, /images/site/adobe-express-file-3-p-1080.webp 1080w, /images/site/adobe-express-file-3.webp 1251w\" class=\"feature-image\"><div class=\"block-feature\"><div class=\"pill-feature\"><h3 class=\"title-feature\">Fire &amp; Lighting Features</h3></div><p class=\"feature-text\">Fire bowls, fire pits, and architectural lighting create dramatic outdoor environments, extending usability into the evening while enhancing ambiance, safety, and visual depth.</p></div></div><div class=\"feature-card\"><img src=\"/images/site/adobe-express-file-4.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" sizes=\"(max-width: 767px) 100vw, (max-width: 991px) 727.9817504882812px, 939.9739379882812px\" srcset=\"/images/site/adobe-express-file-4-p-500.webp 500w, /images/site/adobe-express-file-4-p-800.webp 800w, /images/site/adobe-express-file-4-p-1080.webp 1080w, /images/site/adobe-express-file-4.webp 1260w\" class=\"feature-image\"><div class=\"block-feature\"><div class=\"pill-feature\"><h3 class=\"title-feature\">Safety &amp; Comfort</h3></div><p class=\"feature-text\">Integrated safety and comfort features include slip-resistant surfaces, pool covers, handrails, and code-compliant barriers—designed to meet Florida regulations without sacrificing aesthetics.</p></div></div><div class=\"feature-card\"><img src=\"/images/site/adobe-express-file-5.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" sizes=\"(max-width: 767px) 100vw, (max-width: 991px) 727.9817504882812px, 939.9869384765625px\" srcset=\"/images/site/adobe-express-file-5-p-500.webp 500w, /images/site/adobe-express-file-5-p-800.webp 800w, /images/site/adobe-express-file-5-p-1080.webp 1080w, /images/site/adobe-express-file-5.webp 1251w\" class=\"feature-image\"><div class=\"block-feature\"><div class=\"pill-feature\"><h3 class=\"title-feature\">Outdoor Living Enhancements</h3></div><p class=\"feature-text\">Outdoor living design-build enhancements include outdoor kitchens, pergolas, hardscaping, and architectural shade structures—fully integrated to create a cohesive, high-end outdoor environment.</p></div></div></div><div class=\"w-embed w-script\"><style>\n/* Solo desktop (≥ 992px) */\n@media screen and (min-width: 992px) {\n  .feature-text {\n    opacity: 0;\n    transition: opacity 200ms;\n  }\n\n  .feature-card.is-active .block-feature .feature-text {\n    opacity: 1;\n  }\n}\n</style>\n\n\n\n\n<script>\ndocument.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', function() {\n  // Solo activar animación si realmente estamos en desktop\n  var isDesktop = window.matchMedia(\"(min-width: 992px)\").matches;\n  if (!isDesktop) return;\n\n  var wrapper = document.querySelector('.wrapper-feature');\n  if (!wrapper) return;\n\n  var cards = wrapper.querySelectorAll('.feature-card');\n  if (!cards.length) return;\n\n  // Solo el primer card activo al cargar\n  cards.forEach(function(card, index) {\n    card.classList.toggle('is-active', index === 0);\n  });\n\n  // Click → ese card se expande, los otros se contraen\n  cards.forEach(function(card) {\n    card.addEventListener('click', function() {\n      cards.forEach(function(c) {\n        c.classList.remove('is-active');\n      });\n      card.classList.add('is-active');\n    });\n  });\n});\n</script></div></div></section><section class=\"projects-section\"><div class=\"w-layout-blockcontainer cont